# Unreal binary assets can't be diffed or merged: store them in Git LFS so every
# saved revision doesn't bloat the Git history. Not `lockable` - that makes files
# read-only until locked, which blocks saving in the editor for a solo workflow.
*.uasset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.umap   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
